OL,3,GNEWSAEverton star reveals photo album
OL,4,Acapturing life behind the scenes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPremier League star Merlin Rohl has
OL,7,Freleased a collection of pictures
OL,8,Fdocumenting behind-the-scenes moments
OL,9,Fduring his time playing for Everton -
OL,10,Ftwo years after discovering a love for
OL,11,Fphotography.
OL,13,FCalled Behind the Lens: Life with
OL,14,FEverton, the album captures the people,
OL,15,Fplaces and dramas that have shaped the
OL,16,FGerman's introduction to life with the
OL,17,FToffees.
OL,19,FAsked what his favourite element of
OL,20,Fphotography was, the 24-year-old said:
OL,21,F"I think memories. I can hold on to
OL,22,Fsomething that normally just goes away.
